<%- include('partials/header', { 
    metaTitle: 'Water Baptism Guide | Public Declaration of Faith | EUCMD',
    metaDesc: 'Biblical foundation of water baptism, public confession of faith, and how to register for baptism classes in Silver Spring, Maryland.',
    currentPath: '/water-baptism'
}) %>
<%- include('partials/navbar') %>

<main class="min-h-screen text-white pt-24 pb-20 selection:bg-cyan-500 selection:text-black relative overflow-hidden">

    <!-- Ambient Cosmic Spotlight Beams -->
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-40 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[800px] h-[550px] bg-gradient-to-b from-cyan-400/20 via-sky-500/10 to-transparent blur-3xl -z-10"></div>
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute top-1/3 -left-32 w-96 h-96 bg-sky-500/15 rounded-full blur-3xl -z-10"></div>
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute top-2/3 -right-32 w-96 h-96 bg-cyan-400/15 rounded-full blur-3xl -z-10"></div>

    <!-- Hero Header -->
    <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-8 pb-10 text-center">
        <div class="azure-glass-shell p-8 sm:p-12 relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="diamond-glint" style="top: 2rem; right: 3rem;"></div>
            
            <div class="azure-pill inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 animate-pulse"></span>
                <span>Track 02 · <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('waterBaptism.heroSubtitle') : 'Declare your faith through the waters' %></span>
            </div>

            <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-heading font-black tracking-tight uppercase text-white mb-4">
                <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('waterBaptism.heroTitle') : 'Go Public.' %>
            </h1>

            <p class="text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
                An outward expression of an inward reality: identifying with Christ in death, burial, and resurrection.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Main Study Content Shell -->
    <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pb-16">
        <div class="azure-glass-shell p-8 sm:p-12 relative overflow-hidden space-y-10">
            <div class="diamond-glint" style="bottom: 2rem; right: 2rem;"></div>

            <!-- Header & Read Time -->
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-white/10 pb-6">
                <div>
                    <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-400/10 border border-cyan-400/30 text-cyan-300 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">
                        <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('common.readTime', { min: '3' }) : '3 MIN READ' %>
                    </span>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-tight mt-3">
                        <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('waterBaptism.title') : 'Water Baptism' %>
                    </h2>
                </div>
                <div class="w-24 h-1 rounded-full cyan-progress-fill"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Section 1 -->
            <div class="space-y-4">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold uppercase text-white flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="text-cyan-400">✦</span>
                    <span><%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('waterBaptism.section1.title') : 'What Is Baptism?' %></span>
                </h3>
                <div class="azure-inner-card p-6 border-l-4 border-l-cyan-400 my-4">
                    <p class="text-cyan-200 text-sm sm:text-base italic leading-relaxed">
                        <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('waterBaptism.section1.q1') : 'Baptism does not save you — Jesus does. Baptism is an act of joyful obedience to the One who saved you. Before Jesus ascended, He gave this command: "Go therefore and make disciples of all nations, baptizing them in the name of the Father and of the Son and of the Holy Spirit" (Matthew 28:19).' %>
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="azure-inner-card p-6 border-l-4 border-l-cyan-400 my-4">
                    <p class="text-cyan-200 text-sm sm:text-base italic leading-relaxed">
                        <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('waterBaptism.section1.q2') : 'Peter declared on the day of Pentecost: "Repent and be baptized, every one of you, in the name of Jesus Christ for the forgiveness of your sins" (Acts 2:38). Baptism is your outward picture of an inward reality.' %>
                    </p>
                </div>
                <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
                    <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('waterBaptism.section1.p1') : 'When you go under the water, it represents the burial of your old life — buried with Christ. When you come up out of the water, it represents resurrection — raised to walk in newness of life (Romans 6:3-4).' %>
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Section 2 -->
            <div class="space-y-4 pt-4 border-t border-white/10">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold uppercase text-white flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="text-cyan-400">✦</span>
                    <span><%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('waterBaptism.section2.title') : 'Why Get Baptized?' %></span>
                </h3>
                <div class="azure-inner-card p-6 border-l-4 border-l-cyan-400 my-4">
                    <p class="text-cyan-200 text-sm sm:text-base italic leading-relaxed">
                        <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('waterBaptism.section2.q1') : 'First and most importantly: because Jesus did it (Matthew 3:13-17). If Jesus considered baptism essential to fulfill all righteousness, it matters deeply for every believer.' %>
                    </p>
                </div>
                <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
                    <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('waterBaptism.section2.p1') : 'Baptism is your public confession that you belong to Christ in a culture that tries to define your identity.' %>
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Section 3 -->
            <div class="space-y-4 pt-4 border-t border-white/10">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold uppercase text-white flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="text-cyan-400">✦</span>
                    <span><%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('waterBaptism.section3.title') : 'Who Should Be Baptized?' %></span>
                </h3>
                <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
                    <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('waterBaptism.section3.p1') : 'If you have made a personal decision to follow Jesus Christ as your Lord and Savior, you are ready to be baptized. It does not require years of perfection, only genuine faith in Jesus.' %>
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Section 4 -->
            <div class="space-y-4 pt-4 border-t border-white/10">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold uppercase text-white flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="text-cyan-400">✦</span>
                    <span><%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('waterBaptism.section4.title') : 'What to Expect' %></span>
                </h3>
                <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
                    <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('waterBaptism.section4.p1') : 'Baptism Sunday is a celebration! You will be guided by leaders, declare your faith, and be baptized in water while your church family rejoices and prays over you.' %>
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- CTA Button -->
            <div class="pt-6">
                <a href="/join" class="azure-primary-btn w-full block text-center py-4 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider">
                    <%= typeof t !== 'undefined' ? t('waterBaptism.ctaBtn') : 'Sign Up for Water Baptism' %> &rarr;
                </a>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Join Us Section -->
    <%- include('partials/join-section') %>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
